Attribution — upstream works this project is a derivative of
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SwiftOPL3 is a function-by-function transcription of the following LGPL-2.1
works. Their source code is NOT included in this repository; it is referenced
in the documentation and cloned on demand into References/ (gitignored) only to
regenerate the verification fixtures. All credit for the original algorithms,
tables, and behaviour belongs to their authors.

1. Nuked-OPL3 — the OPL3 (YMF262) emulator
     Copyright (C) 2013-2020 Nuke.YKT
     https://github.com/nukeykt/Nuked-OPL3
     Licensed under the GNU LGPL 2.1.
     ⇒ transcribed into Sources/SwiftOPL3/ (opl3.c / opl3.h).

2. AdPlug — `src/adl.cpp` (CadlPlayer), the Westwood ADL player
     Copyright (C) 1999-2007 Simon Peter et al.
     https://github.com/adplug/adplug
     Licensed under the GNU LGPL 2.1.
     ⇒ transcribed into Sources/WestwoodADL/ (adl.cpp / adl.h).

   AdPlug's adl.cpp is itself a port of the ScummVM / Kyra AdLib driver
   (engines/kyra/sound/drivers/adlib.cpp), by Torbjörn Andersson and Johannes
   Schickel ('lordhoto'), https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm — used as a
   cross-reference oracle.

